Notebook[{Cell["IrrepForm", "ObjectName"], Cell["IrrepForm is an option of \
TensorDecomposition, TensorIrrepList and CGCacheInformation: \"Index\" (irrep \
indices), \"ID\" (irrep IDs) or \"Label\" (the irreps' labels).", "Usage"], 
  Cell["Status: Alpha.", "Notes"], Cell["Option of TensorDecomposition, \
TensorIrrepList, CGCacheInformation and ModularDimensionTable: how irreps key \
the result. \"Index\" (the default except for CGCacheInformation), \"ID\" or \
\"Label\" (user label, else index).", "Notes"], 
  Cell["How irreps are named in the result: \"Index\", \"ID\" or \"Label\".", 
   "Notes"], Cell["See Also", "SeeAlsoSection"], 
